# Contact form email (EmailJS, https://www.emailjs.com)
# 1. Email Services  -> add Gmail, connect your Gmail account   -> copy the Service ID
# 2. Email Templates -> create a template (see README)          -> copy the Template ID
# 3. Account -> General -> Public Key                            -> copy it
# Put the three values in a file named .env.local, then run `npm run build`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
